": ["2113284256097046986"], "id": "2113284256097046986", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1324, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112891667715940463", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "$META Muse, six weeks in:\n\n- 10M+ people in the US and Canada have set up a Muse agent\n- 25% of them use it daily (roughly 2.5M - 3M  daily users)\n- #1 in the App Store almost every day since launch\n- Shopping is the #1 use case with over 25% of users and an average purchase over https://t.co/VqASFb0ezw", "url": "https://x.com/FindleysFinance/status/2113284256097046986"}, {"author_id": "2909689998", "created_at": "2026-10-22T14:51:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113282005974876663"], "id": "2113282005974876663", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic just shipped Claude Duet — a proactive agent that doesn’t wait for you to open a chat.\n\nBuilt on Opus 5.5. It briefs you in the morning, watches your connected apps (6,000+ connectors), works in the background on its own cloud computer, and only pings when something", "url": "https://x.com/Sachi_0298/status/2113282005974876663"}, {"article": {"title": "用完 12 个 Personal Agent 后，我找到了决定好用上限的五个标准"}, "author_id": "1685355844119220225", "created_at": "2026-10-22T14:31:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113277101629669865"], "id": "2113277101629669865", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 1746, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/y9p3Ajo6h4", "url": "https://x.com/aiwarts/status/2113277101629669865"}, {"author_id": "72793235", "created_at": "2026-10-22T14:09:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113271430410637512"], "id": "2113271430410637512", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic launches Claude Duet, an always-on proactive agent built on Opus 5.5 to rival Meta Muse and OpenAI Dots 📰", "url": "https://x.com/Zaardaar/status/2113271430410637512"}, {"author_id": "1493511301808721921", "created_at": "2026-10-22T14:00:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113269175808577561"], "id": "2113269175808577561", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1493511301808721921", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113269172746801359", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Next, I tried the Meta Muse models, and both Spark and Wonder gave me the same refusals. I tried Qwen 28 Uncensored and finally got a (bad) translation. Then I tried DeepSeek 4.1 Flash, and it managed to provide a translation as well.", "url": "https://x.com/ikuznetsov_com/status/2113269175808577561"}, {"author_id": "2094779202318860288", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:58:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113268761453060476"], "id": "2113268761453060476", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 99, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "✨ AI | 🔴 Live News\n\n🧠 Models, Agents &amp; Apps\n- Nvidia ($NVDA) unveiled the OpenShell reference architecture at GTC Berlin, combining Vera Rubin NVL72 racks, BlueField-4 DPUs and Sentry software to isolate and monitor AI agents; Dell, Cisco, HPE, Lenovo and Supermicro are", "url": "https://x.com/neo_logos_/status/2113268761453060476"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113262253956845569"]}, "author_id": "269566390", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:38:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113263695711121494"], "id": "2113263695711121494", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 1328, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I stopped using Claude and Claude Code. I use Grok Bot all day now.\n\nGrok Bot runs 24/7 in the cloud and has its own computer, so it gets stuff done without me micro managing. \n\nHere are my favorite Bots I've created: \n\n1. GTM - runs outbound campaigns end to end, using tools https://t.co/b16FUXNpXr", "url": "https://x.com/mfishbein/status/2113263695711121494"}, {"author_id": "1614111274396418049", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:33:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113262357539660100"], "id": "2113262357539660100", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I built MuseKu, a free place to find and share Meta Muse invite codes.\n\nHave a code with uses left? Post it so someone can use it. Need one? Browse what others have shared.\n\nhttps://t.co/t3hU5baodJ\n\n#MetaMuse", "url": "https://x.com/zhaojianming40/status/2113262357539660100"}, {"author_id": "1661732000", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:28:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113261225844842839"], "id": "2113261225844842839", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "*Walmart ($WMT) unveiled Agent Gateway, a platform allowing approved AI agents to search products and make purchases across Walmart and Sam's Club, embracing AI-powered shopping as rival Amazon ($AMZN) restricts autonomous purchasing.*\n\n• *AI Integrations:* Built using", "url": "https://x.com/cartridge998/status/2113261225844842839"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113249261106458625"]}, "author_id": "1840313948152717312", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:41:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113249276772159576"], "id": "2113249276772159576", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "meta muse wonder is now on opencode \n\n→ 1m context window\n→ built for coding and long-running agent tasks\n→ $4 per 1m input tokens\n→ $20 per 1m output tokens\n\nnot free, but more free models are available on opencode.\n\ndownload: https://t.co/l667QkHl6H https://t.co/LKfoN6DkMA", "url": "https://x.com/27_bishal/status/2113249276772159576"}, {"author_id": "1718351478237376512", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:22:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113244495949054160"], "id": "2113244495949054160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic just opened the research preview for Claude Duet — a Claude that messages *you* first. A morning brief of what matters across your connected apps, background tasks on its own cloud VM, keeps working after you close the app. Built around Opus 5.5. US Pro/Max waitlist", "url": "https://x.com/kaelfrontier/status/2113244495949054160"}, {"article": {"title": "Daily AI News Brief For Thursday October 22nd, 2026"}, "author_id": "1868270318936334336", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:04:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113240105557033152"], "id": "2113240105557033152", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 224, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Follow For the Daily Team Thor Ai News Report: 📰 https://t.co/T9yOee8ova", "url": "https://x.com/Team_Thor_AI/status/2113240105557033152"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2113307067662618626", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVP5lM1aUAIfPPQ.png"}, {"media_key": "3_2113262253956845569", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVPQ0sxW0AE30oV.png"}, {"media_key": "3_2113249261106458625", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVPFAaobcAEAV_Q.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "6452362", "name": "Mike Gannotti 🔳", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2029534512888328193/t6p-CjBb_normal.jpg", "username": "Mich